Adjust pH to 7.0 <br>
Mix ingredients except NaHCO<sub>3</sub> and L-Cysteine&#183;HCl&#183;H<sub>2</sub>O. Bring to a boil and cool under CO<sub>2</sub> gas stream, then add NaHCO<sub>3</sub> and L-Cysteine&#183;HCl&#183;H<sub>2</sub>O to the medium. Dispense the medium into suitable culture vessels under a stream of CO<sub>2</sub>, seal with butyl rubber stoppers, and autoclave.    <br>
To prepare the clarified rumen fluid, preheat rumen content at 120C for 15 min. Use the supernatant after centrifuging at 25,000 x g for 15 min.       <br>
